// GRBL alarm + error code reference.
//
// Coverage:
//   - Grbl 1.1: complete alarms (1-9) and errors (1-38).
//   - grblHAL: common alarm extensions (10-17) and the most-encountered
//     error extensions (39-47, 60-62). grblHAL has many more error codes;
//     unknown codes still render with an "Unknown" badge.
//   - FluidNC: code numbers overlap with Grbl 1.1; FluidNC may use additional
//     descriptive text but the numeric codes match.
//
// Each entry:
//   title       short identifier
//   description what it means in plain English
//   causes      array of likely causes (optional)
//   fixes       array of suggested fixes (optional)
//   flavors     which firmware(s) the code applies to

